speechtext:
November 10, 1969
Questions
following matters and to report to the House such proposals as the committee may deem advisable:
1.	The Canada Elections Act, exclusive of Sections 62 and 63;
2.	The report of the Representation Commissioner on methods of registration of electors and absentee voting, 1968, made pursuant to Section 9 of the Representation Commissioner Act;
And that the evidence adduced by the committee in its study of the aforementioned items during the first session of the twenty-eighth Parliament be referred to the committee.
